# winpad's builds, a sha256 each: the release workflow builds component/winpad/ at the
# tag in the pinned Debian 12 image the player builds in, and refuses to
# publish a binary whose sha256 is not the line here; `spark-shell on
# desktop` installs only the file that has it. CI's winpad job checks the line
# too: the first build of a new one prints the sha256 to pin.
WINPAD_SHA256_X86_64_LINUX_GNU=83ac6f8afe708ee0e2ba89a16a46c6314357e9c15c3ac0fa3172b1640c24fd39
